# expect: orders a non-numeric value
# stage: compile
# An ordering on an enum, as in ordering-on-enum.rule, but written inside a
# `none of`. Every check that walks a rule has to reach into negations: they
# are where a rule writes its hardest conditions, and a check that stops at
# the top level exempts them.
rule demo.order-nested v0.1
says "x"
subject holder
collection readings : measurement for subject via of
conclude Hit when
  some measurement m in readings
  require m.test-code = a
  none of
    some measurement n in readings
    require n.test-code >= a
